    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.00",
    "summary": "Both players take part. Units pile in to bring as many models as possible into engagement. Melee attacks follow in the Fight Step, then units consolidate. There are five steps in all, from Start of Fight Phase to End of Fight Phase.",
